1
00:00:01,080 --> 00:00:03,800
[KAZUMA] Hey! You think
you can just run out on us?

2
00:00:03,880 --> 00:00:05,630
And then leave
behind a measly letter

3
00:00:05,720 --> 00:00:06,510
saying, "goodbye?"

4
00:00:06,590 --> 00:00:09,510
Sorry, but the three of us
refuse these terms!

5
00:00:09,590 --> 00:00:12,010
[ALL] [chanting]
Darkness! Darkness!

6
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:14,100
I'm afraid
I must ask you all to go.

7
00:00:14,180 --> 00:00:16,520
Milady's refusing
to see any visitors.

8
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:17,730
[gasps]

9
00:00:18,650 --> 00:00:19,650
Oh, look...

10
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:20,940
this little bag here
just happened

11
00:00:21,020 --> 00:00:22,770
to fall into your pocket.

12
00:00:22,980 --> 00:00:24,730
Now then,
if you'll open up the gate

13
00:00:24,820 --> 00:00:26,070
and quietly let us
through that would--

14
00:00:26,150 --> 00:00:28,360
What? I am not a man
who takes bribes!

15
00:00:28,450 --> 00:00:30,070
[KAZUMA] This note
doesn't tell us anything,

16
00:00:30,160 --> 00:00:31,620
- dammit!
- [AQUA] Exactly!

17
00:00:31,700 --> 00:00:34,660
So we demand an explanation
right now, understand?

18
00:00:34,740 --> 00:00:37,580
[ALL] [chanting]
Darkness! Darkness!

19
00:00:37,660 --> 00:00:39,330
[HAGEN]
Quickly! The guards!

20
00:00:39,410 --> 00:00:41,420
Summon the guards at once!

21
00:00:41,790 --> 00:00:43,000
- [all gasp]
- [ALL] Da...

22
00:00:43,130 --> 00:00:44,840
[KAZUMA] We're gonna go
make lunch now!

23
00:00:44,920 --> 00:00:47,510
So, you'd better
show up for it!

24
00:02:17,470 --> 00:02:19,260
[KAZUMA] She's being
such a pain in the ass!

25
00:02:19,350 --> 00:02:20,640
Fine I don't care!

26
00:02:20,730 --> 00:02:22,430
Yeah, you can say
that all you want

27
00:02:22,520 --> 00:02:23,770
but you're working
on a new product

28
00:02:23,850 --> 00:02:25,230
- for her sake, aren't ya?
- [gasps]

29
00:02:25,310 --> 00:02:27,110
You-You've gotta be
kiddin' me!

30
00:02:27,190 --> 00:02:28,520
Hasn't it ever occurred
to you that

31
00:02:28,610 --> 00:02:30,030
hoarding wealth is fun?

32
00:02:30,110 --> 00:02:31,110
Whatever.

33
00:02:31,190 --> 00:02:32,900
Word of advice,
a demonic prophecy

34
00:02:32,990 --> 00:02:33,990
is almost always...

35
00:02:34,070 --> 00:02:36,410
[KAZUMA]
I just don't want a real job!

36
00:02:36,660 --> 00:02:38,030
[groans]

37
00:02:38,620 --> 00:02:40,080
[indistinct chatter]

38
00:02:42,160 --> 00:02:43,160
Hey.

39
00:02:43,250 --> 00:02:45,880
If I give you some money,
will you head back home?

40
00:02:46,250 --> 00:02:47,790
I have every right
to take part

41
00:02:47,880 --> 00:02:50,800
in choosing our new member,
so that's what I plan to do.

42
00:02:52,590 --> 00:02:54,050
[panting]

43
00:02:54,930 --> 00:02:56,590
Abandoning someone
after overcoming

44
00:02:56,680 --> 00:02:57,720
so much together?

45
00:02:57,800 --> 00:02:59,850
You're a demon, Kazuma!
Demoniacal!

46
00:02:59,930 --> 00:03:01,310
Would you gimme a break!

47
00:03:01,390 --> 00:03:04,140
She's the one who told us
to find someone new.

48
00:03:05,730 --> 00:03:07,150
Uh-huh?

49
00:03:07,230 --> 00:03:08,610
Listen, when it comes
to endurance,

50
00:03:08,690 --> 00:03:10,270
we totally suck
and you know it!

51
00:03:10,360 --> 00:03:12,280
We need a tank, okay?

52
00:03:12,480 --> 00:03:14,110
[birds chirping]

53
00:03:18,070 --> 00:03:19,780
All I did was introduce myself.

54
00:03:19,950 --> 00:03:22,080
You freaking sabotaged me!

55
00:03:22,160 --> 00:03:24,040
My name is Megumin!

56
00:03:24,120 --> 00:03:26,420
Regarded as Axel's
foremost wielder of magic,

57
00:03:26,500 --> 00:03:28,670
and one who controls
Explosion magic!

58
00:03:28,750 --> 00:03:30,540
You may have heard
of me, locally,

59
00:03:30,630 --> 00:03:33,630
I'm often referred to as
"the crazy Explosion girl!"

60
00:03:34,510 --> 00:03:37,010
Oh, crap, I have heard of her.
Sorry!

61
00:03:37,090 --> 00:03:38,720
But, I'm not ready
to sign up for all this!

62
00:03:38,800 --> 00:03:40,180
So, you'll have
to get somebody else!

63
00:03:40,260 --> 00:03:41,510
Huh!

64
00:03:41,600 --> 00:03:43,680
We actually found a guy
who was interested.

65
00:03:43,770 --> 00:03:44,810
But, now?

66
00:03:44,890 --> 00:03:47,060
These people won't even
make eye contact with us

67
00:03:47,150 --> 00:03:49,190
after that damn
show you put on!

68
00:03:49,730 --> 00:03:51,860
Oh, well, it is what it is.

69
00:03:53,070 --> 00:03:55,110
Why don't we go home
for today, then?

70
00:03:55,190 --> 00:03:56,820
You did that on purpose!

71
00:03:56,900 --> 00:03:57,910
You were trying'
to make sure no one else...

72
00:03:57,990 --> 00:03:59,660
[DUST]
Kazuma!

73
00:03:59,740 --> 00:04:01,490
[KAZUMA]
Why are you in such a panic?

74
00:04:01,580 --> 00:04:02,830
There's big trouble brewing

75
00:04:02,910 --> 00:04:04,040
and I need your help!

76
00:04:04,120 --> 00:04:06,250
[KAZUMA] This dude ran
head-first at a hydra,

77
00:04:06,330 --> 00:04:08,120
and now he's this worked up?

78
00:04:08,210 --> 00:04:09,500
♪

79
00:04:09,580 --> 00:04:11,210
Sounds pretty serious!

80
00:04:11,290 --> 00:04:12,880
I better go check it out!

81
00:04:13,800 --> 00:04:16,220
This is about Rin
going out with some guy?

82
00:04:16,300 --> 00:04:17,510
Yeah, that's right!

83
00:04:17,590 --> 00:04:19,300
And I'm worried that
one of my good buddies

84
00:04:19,380 --> 00:04:21,180
might be in the clutches
of a real creep!

85
00:04:21,260 --> 00:04:22,970
[KAZUMA]
Okay, fair enough.

86
00:04:23,560 --> 00:04:26,350
[DUST] Lately she hasn't really
been that social at all.

87
00:04:26,430 --> 00:04:28,230
I got curious,
so I watched her

88
00:04:28,310 --> 00:04:29,690
around the clock.

89
00:04:30,100 --> 00:04:31,730
And she went
into an inn with some guy

90
00:04:31,810 --> 00:04:34,230
- I didn't recognize!
- Hang on you're stalking--

91
00:04:34,320 --> 00:04:35,860
I gotta look out
for my pal, right?

92
00:04:35,940 --> 00:04:38,200
Please I need your help!

93
00:04:39,030 --> 00:04:42,660
As vaguely creepy
as I find this I'll do it!

94
00:04:42,740 --> 00:04:45,040
[chuckles] I knew
you'd understand, Kazuma!

95
00:04:45,120 --> 00:04:46,370
Take this!

96
00:04:46,950 --> 00:04:48,160
[DUST]
Here's the place.

97
00:04:48,250 --> 00:04:49,250
It's where that scumbag

98
00:04:49,330 --> 00:04:51,130
who's been tricking
Rin hides out.

99
00:04:51,790 --> 00:04:53,670
You aren't just
gonna bust in, are ya?

100
00:04:53,750 --> 00:04:55,130
Do you know how many years

101
00:04:55,210 --> 00:04:56,670
I've been an adventurer?

102
00:04:57,090 --> 00:04:58,970
You don't survive long
in this kinda job

103
00:04:59,050 --> 00:05:01,300
unless you're always
fully prepared.

104
00:05:01,380 --> 00:05:02,760
[gulps]

105
00:05:02,850 --> 00:05:04,510
♪

106
00:05:06,020 --> 00:05:08,350
The walls are thin here,
so be careful.

107
00:05:08,430 --> 00:05:10,600
Sure, you're not stalking?

108
00:05:10,690 --> 00:05:12,150
[NOBLE 09-A (M)] Oh, Miss Rin!

109
00:05:12,230 --> 00:05:14,810
I cannot help the way
I truly feel!

110
00:05:15,190 --> 00:05:16,570
- [RIN] Calm down!
- [both gasp]

111
00:05:16,650 --> 00:05:18,530
A noble can't be
this infatuated

112
00:05:18,610 --> 00:05:19,990
with an adventurer!

113
00:05:20,360 --> 00:05:21,360
[NOBLE 09-A (M)]
I'm fully aware

114
00:05:21,450 --> 00:05:23,030
of our different standings!

115
00:05:23,120 --> 00:05:24,450
If nothing else,
then please let me

116
00:05:24,530 --> 00:05:26,660
get a picture
with this magic camera!

117
00:05:26,740 --> 00:05:27,790
[RIN]
Calm yourself!

118
00:05:27,870 --> 00:05:29,960
You have to settle down!
Think clearly!

119
00:05:30,040 --> 00:05:31,330
[KAZUMA]
I get it.

120
00:05:31,460 --> 00:05:33,880
He knows the two of them
can never be together

121
00:05:33,960 --> 00:05:36,420
so he wants a picture
to remember her by.

122
00:05:36,500 --> 00:05:38,300
Sounds kinda reasonable to me?

123
00:05:38,380 --> 00:05:39,840
[NOBLE 09-A (M)]
I want a lascivious one!

124
00:05:39,920 --> 00:05:42,260
Something lewd
and salacious, if you please!

125
00:05:42,340 --> 00:05:44,220
[KAZUMA]
Nope, that guy's a scumbag!

126
00:05:44,840 --> 00:05:47,310
Well, that does it.
I've got an ass to kick.

127
00:05:47,390 --> 00:05:48,810
Easy don't do this!

128
00:05:48,890 --> 00:05:50,270
Simmer down!

129
00:05:50,350 --> 00:05:52,600
[RIN] Just try and relax
for a minute! Okay?

130
00:05:52,690 --> 00:05:53,940
We can go downstairs,
have some tea, and then we...

131
00:05:54,020 --> 00:05:55,230
[NOBLE 09-A (M)]
I'm begging you!

132
00:05:55,310 --> 00:05:58,070
Something bawdy
and titillating!

133
00:06:02,740 --> 00:06:03,910
♪

134
00:06:03,990 --> 00:06:05,530
He wasn't kidding.

135
00:06:05,870 --> 00:06:07,240
Unbelievable.

136
00:06:07,330 --> 00:06:09,000
I'll show him
what he can do with this crap!

137
00:06:09,080 --> 00:06:11,960
Hey, if you mess up
the room then--

138
00:06:12,080 --> 00:06:13,540
Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow.

139
00:06:13,620 --> 00:06:15,040
[groan]
[gasp]

140
00:06:15,460 --> 00:06:17,130
♪

141
00:06:17,590 --> 00:06:18,880
- [DUST] Kazuma.
- [KAZUMA] I'm Kazuma.

142
00:06:18,960 --> 00:06:20,510
[DUST] You're gonna take
some pictures of me.

143
00:06:20,590 --> 00:06:21,510
[KAZUMA]
Okay.

144
00:06:21,590 --> 00:06:24,090
[DUST] We'll cover every bit
of that film with my flesh.

145
00:06:24,180 --> 00:06:27,220
Giving that sleaze a whole
lifetime worth of trauma!

146
00:06:27,390 --> 00:06:29,140
[whimpering]

147
00:06:29,510 --> 00:06:30,810
[sighs]

148
00:06:30,890 --> 00:06:32,680
♪

149
00:06:32,890 --> 00:06:33,890
[KAZUMA]
All right.

150
00:06:33,980 --> 00:06:36,440
Don't go getting
cold feet on me, now.

151
00:06:36,770 --> 00:06:38,070
[DUST]
Of course not.

152
00:06:38,150 --> 00:06:39,610
[KAZUMA]
Okay, you're fierce!

153
00:06:39,690 --> 00:06:41,030
You're a tomcat!
[camera shutter clicking]

154
00:06:41,440 --> 00:06:42,990
[camera shutter clicks]

155
00:06:43,070 --> 00:06:44,650
♪

156
00:06:46,780 --> 00:06:48,780
[KAZUMA] I don't even know
how many shots we took.

157
00:06:48,870 --> 00:06:50,950
I just kept snapping away.

158
00:06:51,040 --> 00:06:52,120
♪

159
00:06:52,410 --> 00:06:55,290
Looking down at Dust
as I stood on a table.

160
00:06:55,370 --> 00:06:57,040
Ground-level shots.

161
00:06:57,130 --> 00:06:59,880
We were trying
every angle imaginable.

162
00:07:00,550 --> 00:07:02,170
Okay, let's go for something

163
00:07:02,260 --> 00:07:03,800
a little more impressive now!

164
00:07:03,880 --> 00:07:05,590
Spread your legs,
drop your hips!

165
00:07:05,680 --> 00:07:07,720
Good exactly like that!

166
00:07:07,890 --> 00:07:08,930
[thuds]

167
00:07:09,010 --> 00:07:10,970
- All ready to sumo!
- All ready to sumo!

168
00:07:11,060 --> 00:07:12,890
[both laughing]

169
00:07:15,690 --> 00:07:17,020
- [door opens]
- [gasps]

170
00:07:17,900 --> 00:07:19,440
[laughing]

171
00:07:23,030 --> 00:07:24,530
[both whimpering]

172
00:07:25,070 --> 00:07:27,320
[RIN]
So, what the hell is this?

173
00:07:27,950 --> 00:07:29,530
- [DUST] We're sorry.
- [KAZUMA] We're sorry.

174
00:07:30,330 --> 00:07:32,490
[KAZUMA] Guess,
we got kinda carried away.

175
00:07:32,580 --> 00:07:33,580
[sighs]

176
00:07:33,660 --> 00:07:36,000
Why did I even
bother worrying, sir?

177
00:07:36,080 --> 00:07:38,790
Well, you know what?
You can enjoy your trash.

178
00:07:39,290 --> 00:07:41,050
- Kazuma, let's go.
- [gasps]

179
00:07:41,130 --> 00:07:43,340
Are you sure leaving
them alone together is.

180
00:07:43,420 --> 00:07:45,260
[RIN] I said, "let's go."

181
00:07:49,680 --> 00:07:50,680
[NOBLE 09-A (M)]
I never expected

182
00:07:50,760 --> 00:07:52,060
to see you here in my room.

183
00:07:52,140 --> 00:07:53,060
What did you say?

184
00:07:53,140 --> 00:07:54,810
Have you got
some kinda problem?

185
00:07:55,310 --> 00:07:56,560
How perfect.

186
00:07:56,640 --> 00:07:58,810
Let's have a little chat,
mano a mano?

187
00:07:58,900 --> 00:08:00,230
[door shuts]

188
00:08:01,230 --> 00:08:03,030
You'd better brace yourself.

189
00:08:03,940 --> 00:08:06,860
Uh, Rin, shouldn't
we stop those two?

190
00:08:06,950 --> 00:08:08,110
Things could get...

191
00:08:08,200 --> 00:08:09,660
- [gasps]
- I really tried, ya know?

192
00:08:09,740 --> 00:08:12,080
'Cause, I wanted
to make the effort.

193
00:08:12,160 --> 00:08:13,700
And then he shows up,
in his room,

194
00:08:13,790 --> 00:08:14,790
dressed like that?

195
00:08:14,870 --> 00:08:16,960
It's like a duck jumping
head-first into boiling water

196
00:08:17,040 --> 00:08:18,920
and closing up
the lid on the pot!

197
00:08:19,710 --> 00:08:21,340
[whimpering]

198
00:08:22,380 --> 00:08:25,420
Amazing! I never imagined I...

199
00:08:25,510 --> 00:08:27,880
Hey, don't go thinking
I'm gonna be intimidated

200
00:08:27,970 --> 00:08:29,470
because you're a noble!

201
00:08:29,550 --> 00:08:30,840
This thing is nothing for me!

202
00:08:30,930 --> 00:08:33,310
I'm used to dealing
with aristocrats and royals.

203
00:08:33,390 --> 00:08:34,640
You are?

204
00:08:35,100 --> 00:08:37,390
Then, this is the proof
that God is real!

205
00:08:37,810 --> 00:08:40,650
I'm glad I converted,
so blessed.

206
00:08:41,020 --> 00:08:42,020
You listen to me!

207
00:08:42,110 --> 00:08:43,570
We're two dudes,
plain and simple.

208
00:08:43,650 --> 00:08:44,860
And none of that
other stuff matters!

209
00:08:44,940 --> 00:08:45,940
- Understand?
- [gasps]

210
00:08:46,030 --> 00:08:48,530
Then you'd pay no mind
to our different status?

211
00:08:48,650 --> 00:08:52,030
Oh, this is a day
that's truly blessed!

212
00:08:52,120 --> 00:08:53,780
I am forever grateful.

213
00:08:53,870 --> 00:08:56,160
Goddess Aqua be praised!

214
00:08:56,250 --> 00:08:57,410
[grunts]

215
00:08:58,910 --> 00:09:01,040
[RIN] Here's the thing,
Dust is the one

216
00:09:01,130 --> 00:09:02,500
that noble likes.

217
00:09:02,830 --> 00:09:04,250
Hang on. Say what?

218
00:09:04,500 --> 00:09:05,840
I'm trying to tell you.

219
00:09:05,920 --> 00:09:07,470
He has a major crush on Dust

220
00:09:07,550 --> 00:09:09,800
and kept pestering me
for advice!

221
00:09:10,130 --> 00:09:11,630
So I tried to talk him
out of it

222
00:09:11,720 --> 00:09:13,680
while being as gentle
as possible

223
00:09:13,760 --> 00:09:15,100
but then he asked to at least

224
00:09:15,180 --> 00:09:16,350
get a picture of Dust.

225
00:09:16,430 --> 00:09:18,640
If that's the case.
Dust must be...

226
00:09:18,730 --> 00:09:20,810
- [screams]
- [gasps]

227
00:09:30,030 --> 00:09:31,700
[KAZUMA]
Nothing happened today.

228
00:09:31,950 --> 00:09:34,660
[RIN]
B-By the way, I heard about

229
00:09:34,740 --> 00:09:35,830
another noble who...

230
00:09:35,910 --> 00:09:36,950
You can stop right there!

231
00:09:37,040 --> 00:09:38,120
Because I don't wanna hear it!

232
00:09:38,200 --> 00:09:40,040
Relax this is something
totally different!

233
00:09:40,120 --> 00:09:41,250
It's about Lalatina.

234
00:09:41,330 --> 00:09:42,670
[KAZUMA]
Darkness?

235
00:09:42,830 --> 00:09:45,000
Everyone in town's
talking about it.

236
00:09:45,080 --> 00:09:47,420
Apparently, the daughter
of the Dustiness family

237
00:09:47,510 --> 00:09:49,880
is getting married
to Aldarp pretty soon.

238
00:09:49,960 --> 00:09:51,430
♪

239
00:09:52,090 --> 00:09:53,800
[both gasp]

240
00:09:55,220 --> 00:09:57,220
I want the details! Right now!

241
00:09:58,350 --> 00:09:59,640
[AQUA]
Married?

242
00:09:59,970 --> 00:10:01,520
Oh, I don't like this at all.

243
00:10:01,600 --> 00:10:04,230
It's turning out just
like that shady demon said.

244
00:10:04,310 --> 00:10:06,730
And you believe
the rumors are actually true?

245
00:10:06,820 --> 00:10:09,780
Vanir didn't really give
a whole lot of specifics.

246
00:10:09,860 --> 00:10:11,360
But one thing's for sure,

247
00:10:11,450 --> 00:10:12,740
we know who's involved now,

248
00:10:12,820 --> 00:10:14,700
so this is gonna
change everything!

249
00:10:14,950 --> 00:10:17,620
We've gotta hear the full story
from Darkness, herself!

250
00:10:17,700 --> 00:10:19,290
Don't we? Don't we?

251
00:10:19,370 --> 00:10:20,540
- Uh-huh. Uh-huh.
- Uh-huh. Uh-huh.

252
00:10:20,620 --> 00:10:22,160
[KAZUMA]
I can't believe it!

253
00:10:22,290 --> 00:10:24,120
That girl's always been
a handful!

254
00:10:24,210 --> 00:10:26,290
But with this news from Rin,
there's no choice.

255
00:10:26,380 --> 00:10:27,960
We have to do something!

256
