[laughs]

518
00:19:23,870 --> 00:19:25,040
[IGNIS]
Kazuma.

519
00:19:26,120 --> 00:19:29,090
I'd appreciate you
not asking for details.

520
00:19:29,290 --> 00:19:31,300
That said, after you have taken

521
00:19:31,380 --> 00:19:32,710
her out of this place,

522
00:19:32,800 --> 00:19:35,050
I will simply need to sell
the mansion off and...

523
00:19:35,130 --> 00:19:36,890
[coughs]

524
00:19:36,970 --> 00:19:38,760
W-What do you need help with?

525
00:19:38,930 --> 00:19:40,220
Because we've got
an arch priest

526
00:19:40,300 --> 00:19:42,680
whose only real value
is her power to heal.

527
00:19:43,180 --> 00:19:45,390
Thank you,
but that kind of magic

528
00:19:45,480 --> 00:19:47,020
has no effect on illness.

529
00:19:47,100 --> 00:19:49,270
And the Resurrection spell
cannot be used

530
00:19:49,360 --> 00:19:52,030
on somebody
who's died of natural causes.

531
00:19:52,110 --> 00:19:54,320
Diseases are just
a part of living.

532
00:19:54,400 --> 00:19:56,030
When one meets
their natural end

533
00:19:56,200 --> 00:19:58,660
no divine miracle
can change that.

534
00:19:59,160 --> 00:20:00,450
[sighs]

535
00:20:01,580 --> 00:20:05,080
Which is why
you needn't look so sad.

536
00:20:09,670 --> 00:20:11,920
[DARKNESS]
Kazuma, get out here!

537
00:20:12,000 --> 00:20:14,460
You will regret ever
mimicking my voice!

538
00:20:14,550 --> 00:20:15,880
[laughs]

539
00:20:16,630 --> 00:20:19,550
Young man,
please look after my girl.

540
00:20:20,050 --> 00:20:22,350
[KAZUMA]
But I really don't wanna.

541
00:20:22,760 --> 00:20:23,970
[door thud open]

542
00:20:24,180 --> 00:20:25,220
Found you!

543
00:20:25,310 --> 00:20:27,270
It is time you are dealt
with properly!

544
00:20:27,350 --> 00:20:29,150
Come on, would you mind
keeping it down a little bit?

545
00:20:29,230 --> 00:20:30,310
[DARKNESS]
Enough out of you!

546
00:20:30,400 --> 00:20:31,520
For being worried about me,

547
00:20:31,610 --> 00:20:33,190
you have managed
to thoroughly sabotage

548
00:20:33,270 --> 00:20:34,900
my reputation
in a single night!

549
00:20:34,990 --> 00:20:37,110
Sorry, but everything
I said was true!

550
00:20:37,200 --> 00:20:39,320
Yet another lie!

551
00:20:39,410 --> 00:20:41,030
Screw this stupid
debt of yours!

552
00:20:41,120 --> 00:20:42,620
Why don't we just
get outta this place?

553
00:20:42,700 --> 00:20:44,660
Besides, it's not like
Aqua and Megumin

554
00:20:44,740 --> 00:20:46,450
are gonna end this
if I come back alone!

555
00:20:46,830 --> 00:20:47,710
Who knows?
Megumin

556
00:20:47,790 --> 00:20:49,370
might explode
the wedding reception!

557
00:20:49,460 --> 00:20:51,130
And if such a thing
were to happen

558
00:20:51,210 --> 00:20:52,540
you would all end up hanging!

559
00:20:52,630 --> 00:20:54,380
So, it is your job
to stop those two!

560
00:20:54,460 --> 00:20:55,630
You have gotta be
the most stubborn

561
00:20:55,710 --> 00:20:57,550
pile of girl muscle
I've ever met!

562
00:20:57,630 --> 00:20:58,840
[growls]

563
00:20:58,930 --> 00:21:00,090
♪

564
00:21:00,340 --> 00:21:01,800
I won't run away!

565
00:21:02,050 --> 00:21:05,180
If I chose to someone
else would suffer.

566
00:21:05,640 --> 00:21:06,770
[grunts]

567
00:21:07,890 --> 00:21:10,060
Yeah, ya know what?
Suit yourself then.

568
00:21:10,150 --> 00:21:12,060
But if you ever get
a clue and want some help,

569
00:21:12,230 --> 00:21:13,400
you know where the mansion is.

570
00:21:13,480 --> 00:21:16,280
You can start with,
"Please, Kazuma, I need you!"

571
00:21:16,360 --> 00:21:17,990
- [thuds]
- [groans]

572
00:21:18,740 --> 00:21:20,990
[KAZUMA]
Strong window.

573
00:21:21,870 --> 00:21:22,820
[glass shatters]

574
00:21:22,910 --> 00:21:24,870
Oh, my goodness!
Are you all right, Kazuma?

575
00:21:24,950 --> 00:21:26,370
♪

576
00:21:26,830 --> 00:21:29,370
Y-You know,
if you ask really nicely,

577
00:21:29,460 --> 00:21:31,210
we can make sure
that you receive treatment

578
00:21:31,290 --> 00:21:33,080
after such an awful fall.

579
00:21:33,540 --> 00:21:35,750
Who needs this crap?

580
00:21:36,170 --> 00:21:37,010
Know what?

581
00:21:37,090 --> 00:21:38,380
I'm not coming' back
to save you

582
00:21:38,460 --> 00:21:40,300
till you come crying
for my help!

583
00:21:40,380 --> 00:21:41,970
Dumbass! Dumbass!

584
00:21:42,050 --> 00:21:43,340
- [screams]
- [thuds]

585
00:21:43,430 --> 00:21:45,060
That didn't even hurt!
Okay.

586
00:21:45,550 --> 00:21:47,140
[both snoring]

587
00:21:50,390 --> 00:21:51,770
[door thud open]

588
00:21:52,310 --> 00:21:54,020
[whimpering]

589
00:21:54,810 --> 00:21:55,900
[KAZUMA]
Aqua!

590
00:21:55,980 --> 00:22:00,320
I need healing!
I need healing! Please!

591
00:23:30,740 --> 00:23:31,830
[VERDIA]
This is Verdia,

592
00:23:31,910 --> 00:23:34,040
general
of the Devil King's army.

593
00:23:34,120 --> 00:23:36,120
And I wanted to write
to you on behalf

594
00:23:36,210 --> 00:23:38,460
of our esteemed organization.

595
00:23:38,540 --> 00:23:40,090
Miss Lalatina Dustiness...

